      "content": "i know there are people to talk to, but it just feels like more work. more explaining. more people trying to \"fix\" me when they dont even get it. it's just... if the world is always gonna be like this, and i'm always gonna have to fight just to exist, what's actually the point? it feels like i'm just running on a treadmill that's going too fast.",
